        "text": "<thinking> To create the `list_prefix.py` file that lists stored objects under a bucket or container prefix, I need to choose a concrete external provider. I will use Amazon S3 as the provider for this task. The code will use the Boto3 library, which is the Amazon Web Services (AWS) SDK for Python, to interact with Amazon S3. This will make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
